Subject: [PATCH 06/10] glm5: investigation hooks for the two-GPU path
 (env-gated, off by default)

Original summary: step2c investigation hooks (env-gated, off by default): per-layer hand-off dump, layer-3 FFN breakdown, router check, cuBLAS stream/workspace knobs, exit after prompt path

STRATA_GLM5_LDUMP/_POS/_LAYER, STRATA_GLM5_PF_ROUTER_CHECK, STRATA_GLM5_PF_BLAS_STREAM,
STRATA_GLM5_PF_WS_SEP, STRATA_GLM5_PF_EXIT.  No behaviour change without them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
